        "original_id": "3b8afce9-689a-5905-8868-89f12b583f34",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Milo Parker, Callan McAuliffe, Ben Kingsley, Gillian Anderson, Anke Engelke, Bastian Pastewka\n- Products: Robot Overlords, Mr. Holmes, Miss Peregrine's Home for Peculiar Children, Ghost Hunters on Icy Trails\n- Roles: Connor, Roger Munro, Hugh Apiston, Hugo\n- Topics: British child actors, film casts, film titles\n\nFacts:\n- Milo Parker, born in 2002, is a British child actor.\n- In the 2014 British independent science fiction film Robot Overlords, Milo Parker played Connor.\n- Robot Overlords was originally titled Our Robot Overlords and starred Callan McAuliffe, Ben Kingsley, and Gillian Anderson.\n- In 2015, Milo Parker starred in the German-Austrian-Irish comedy film Ghost Hunters on Icy Trails alongside Anke Engelke, and Bastian Pastewka voiced Hugo.\n- Milo Parker is also known for playing Roger Munro in Mr. Holmes and Hugh Apiston in Miss Peregrine's Home for Peculiar Children.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
